From 59974eec587e034e1aa306b8dc9687605f1ed736 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nags <nags@kalaa-bhadra.local>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 16:00:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(security): round-3 follow-ups

- Guest Cashfree modal flow: processCheckout live return includes
  guestAccessToken; checkout page appends ?t= on post-payment redirect;
  modal errors reset submitting state.
- Repeat guest buyers: User.isGuest flag; guest checkout reuses its own
  guest rows, still refuses real accounts.
- Webhook confirmation/failure emails carry ?t= tracking URLs.
- Studio cancel: REFUND_REQUIRED alert moved after tx commit; status
  re-verified inside tx via conditional update; multi-studio orders
  cannot be creator-cancelled.
- updateArtworkAction: gallery schema without .default([]) so omitted
  gallery no longer wipes detail images.
- Retry Cashfree order ids: ms timestamp + random (still digits-only
  for the webhook suffix strip).
- OrderStatusUpdater: cancel button with two-click confirm (pre-shipment
  states only).
- Ghost collector@example.com removed from notifications + creator page.
- Copy: order tab title, settlement cycle note.
